---
description: Project rules for the contract clause classifier (applies to every request)
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the repository rules in AGENTS.md at the project root: commands, layout, rules and gotchas.
Read MEMORY.md for design decisions and known pitfalls, and docs/TELEMETRY.md before touching telemetry.

Key reminders:
- Run Python with `uv run`; Python 3.12 with exact pins. Never start full training unless asked; use `make sanity`.
- Keep training device-agnostic (cuda / mps / cpu via config.resolve_device).
- Keep the API OpenAI-compatible and the prediction shape `[{name, confidence}]`.
- `make test` must pass; tests use a stub model (no downloads, no GPU).
- Update CHANGELOG.md for user-visible changes.
- Always update MEMORY.md after completing a task (decisions, measurements, gotchas, dated) before reporting it done. A task is not complete until tests pass and docs, CHANGELOG.md and MEMORY.md are updated.
